        <object label="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:center;font:bold 21px Helvetica;color:#ffffff&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;Shared statutory or structural issue?&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin:10px 0 8px;border-top:1px solid #81a7aa&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left;font:16px/1.3 Helvetica;color:#f3f7f7&quot;&gt;If scope, major questions, delegation, a legislative veto or cancellation is disputed, follow the gold route to the shared Ch. 15 check, then return to the authority decision.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;No such issue? Continue directly. Read statutory limits before claiming inherent power.&lt;/div&gt;" link="data:action/json,{&quot;actions&quot;:[{&quot;scroll&quot;:{&quot;cells&quot;:[&quot;s14&quot;]}}]}" id="exec-deleg">
