        <mxCell id="jud-no-constitutional-issue" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#243338;strokeColor=#9ABDC0;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#F5F5F5;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=11;spacingRight=11;spacingTop=6;spacingBottom=6;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:center;font:bold 21px Helvetica;color:#ffffff&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;No constitutional decision needed&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin:10px 0 8px;border-top:1px solid #81a7aa&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left;font:16px/1.3 Helvetica;color:#f3f7f7&quot;&gt;Resolve the claim on the applicable nonconstitutional grounds and determine relief.&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="140" width="425" x="6555" y="-18700" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="path-jud-nonconstitutional" edge="1" parent="1" source="live" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#FFFFFF;strokeWidth=3.5;endSize=13;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=14;labelBackgroundColor=#141414;" target="jud-no-constitutional-issue" value="No">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="con-power" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#243338;strokeColor=#9ABDC0;strokeWidth=2.5;fontColor=#F5F5F5;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=11;spacingRight=11;spacingTop=6;spacingBottom=6;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:center;font:bold 21px Helvetica;color:#ffffff&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;Does a sufficient power support the act?&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin:10px 0 8px;border-top:1px solid #81a7aa&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left;font:16px/1.3 Helvetica;color:#f3f7f7&quot;&gt;After testing the plausible alternatives, identify a valid grant and means. Failure under one grant does not end the inquiry if another may suffice. If no source supports the act, take the failure exit.&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="240" width="400" x="3710" y="-10359" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="con-stop" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#243338;strokeColor=#9ABDC0;strokeWidth=2.5;fontColor=#F5F5F5;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=11;spacingRight=11;spacingTop=6;spacingBottom=6;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:center;font:bold 21px Helvetica;color:#ffffff&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;Congress: power or limit fails&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin:10px 0 8px;border-top:1px solid #81a7aa&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left;font:16px/1.3 Helvetica;color:#f3f7f7&quot;&gt;Identify the invalid act or provision and its scope. Consider severability and available relief. An agency exceeding a statute does not alone invalidate the statute; assess that executive act separately.&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="180" width="400" x="3710" y="-10750" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
