        <mxCell id="exec-authority" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#243338;strokeColor=#9ABDC0;strokeWidth=2.5;fontColor=#F5F5F5;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=11;spacingRight=11;spacingTop=6;spacingBottom=6;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:center;font:bold 21px Helvetica;color:#ffffff&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;Does authority support this act?&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin:10px 0 8px;border-top:1px solid #81a7aa&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left;font:16px/1.3 Helvetica;color:#f3f7f7&quot;&gt;Apply the selected Youngstown category or specific Article II grant, using any shared-check result. Agencies must stay within delegated authority. For presidential action, test any viable independent constitutional basis if statutory authority fails.&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="230" width="400" x="3710" y="105" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="exec-stop" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#243338;strokeColor=#9ABDC0;strokeWidth=2.5;fontColor=#F5F5F5;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=11;spacingRight=11;spacingTop=6;spacingBottom=6;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:center;font:bold 21px Helvetica;color:#ffffff&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;Executive: authority or structure fails&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin:10px 0 8px;border-top:1px solid #81a7aa&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left;font:16px/1.3 Helvetica;color:#f3f7f7&quot;&gt;Identify the unauthorized act or unconstitutional arrangement, severability and available relief. An unlawful act is not automatically actionable against every defendant; test immunity and remedy separately.&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="170" width="400" x="4395" y="-240" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="exec-remedy" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#243338;strokeColor=#9ABDC0;strokeWidth=2.5;fontColor=#F5F5F5;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=11;spacingRight=11;spacingTop=6;spacingBottom=6;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:center;font:bold 21px Helvetica;color:#ffffff&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;Remaining limits and requested relief&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin:10px 0 8px;border-top:1px solid #81a7aa&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left;font:16px/1.3 Helvetica;color:#f3f7f7&quot;&gt;Check applicable statutory conditions, appropriations and the Take Care duty. Nonenforcement, military action, pardons and recognition need their specific tests (Ch. 13).&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;If accountability or disclosure is at issue, distinguish civil damages, prosecution, prospective relief and privilege (pp. 235–238). Immunity limits relief; it does not itself establish lawfulness. Then test applicable rights.&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="330" width="400" x="5485" y="55" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="exec-relief-stop" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#243338;strokeColor=#9ABDC0;strokeWidth=2.5;fontColor=#F5F5F5;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=11;spacingRight=11;spacingTop=6;spacingBottom=6;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:center;font:bold 21px Helvetica;color:#ffffff&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;If this relief is unavailable&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin:10px 0 8px;border-top:1px solid #81a7aa&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left;font:16px/1.3 Helvetica;color:#f3f7f7&quot;&gt;Dismiss or deny the affected claim or remedy. Consider other defendants, claims and available relief separately. A privilege claim requires its own disclosure analysis; it is not blanket immunity.&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="170" width="400" x="5485" y="-240" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="path-exec-deleg-authority" edge="1" parent="1" source="exec-deleg" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#52F3FF;strokeWidth=7;endSize=16;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;fontSize=14;fontColor=#FFFFFF;labelBackgroundColor=#141414;" target="exec-authority" value="Continue">
