        <mxCell id="Irm28PB6AWfACWCscSZp-1" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#76608a;fontColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#432D57;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 19px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp;Statue vs. Con right&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;Ex parte McCardle (1869)&lt;/i&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;Congress can revoke SCOTUS right for Appellete review for areas giving by Congressional Statue, but Ex Parte McCardle did not answer if that was true for Constitutional rights as well.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;*Political motives don&#39;t matter&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
