        <mxCell id="wovAwqLVVU2Vwa51t1SS-27" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#76608a;fontColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#432D57;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 19px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Constitution supplied no standard for choosing a benchmark&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Rucho&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;For gerrymandering, what would the standard be&amp;nbsp;proportional representation or&amp;nbsp;competitive districts - neither answer was supported by the law&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
